            "review_title": "Review at Ben Bac Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Drew H\nMelbourne, Australia58 contributions\n0\nGreat view of Red River\nJul 2017\nI just went to photograph the river, great views of loaded barges. It was early, before dinner and they were just setting up. The kitchen hand wanted to practice his English, he invited us in & we had coffee. He said he was a killer, did the killing! Perhaps he meant butcher... He was to kill and prepare three ducks & did we want to watch? No thankyou. He was trying hard to have some conversation, not many English speakers here perhaps. No one else seemed to want to speak with us, but we managed to order a small snack as we were not sure if the kitchen was fully operational yet. Ben Bac might be a great place for larger group celebrations as the menu seemed to have large group pricing, we just don't know...\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 16, 2017",
